This package is a DeepSeek Harness host/client UI for Agent Mail.

It does not copy Agent Mail handlers, spawn a second MCP child, store
tokens, or ship a provider binary. Mail transport remains the separately
installed @dff652/dsh-agent-mail MCP bundle and its deployment-owned
agent-mail-mcp executable.

@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client@0.1.1-rc.2 is an optional peer, distributed
under the MIT License from https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.
The dependency is installed separately by the package manager and is not
copied into this bundle tarball.
